split-over-either
owner: fable-5.1 session 53f400ad
started: 2026-09-15
what: the sixteen walkers outside the core still splitting their row
  with `<|>` (an Either per operation): Pipe x10, Writer x4, Source,
  Resource, Logic, Refs, Generate, Condition, Channel, Delim. Converted
  to `split`, measured as a batch on every lane that reaches one, and
  any walker whose lane regresses is REVERTED and recorded — the
  inlining rule has four faces now (Free.resume is 323 bytes, two
  under the line) and a loop that grows past 325 by inlining its arms
  stops inlining into its caller.
files: src/main/scala/{Pipe,Writer,Source,Resource,Logic,Refs,Generate,
  Condition,Channel,Delim}.scala, src/jmh/history.tsv, specs/core-cleanup.md,
  BACKLOG.md, CHANGELOG.md
